Add to src/styles.css:

@import "./styles/raya/core.css";
@import "./styles/raya/systems/baseline.css";

Baseline is the default System: it fills :root/.dark directly. Activate explicitly with <html data-raya="baseline"> if you also install other Systems.

Add to src/styles.css:

@import "./styles/raya/core.css";
@import "./styles/raya/systems/terminal.css";

Activate with <html data-raya="terminal"> (or any wrapper). Requires the core item.
